/.encore
encore.gen.go
encore.gen.cue
/encore.gen

# Encore local-dev secrets override (CUE format, per Encore docs).
# Production / staging values are provisioned via `encore secret set
# --type {prod,dev}`; this file is for local emulator runs only and
# must never be committed. See SPEC §3.5.
/.secrets.local.cue

# Go build artifacts from cmd/<tool> tools.
# `go build ./cmd/<tool>` emits the binary at apps/api/<tool> by default.
# Add new entries here when new cmd/ tools are introduced.
/gen-catalogue
